      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Les Bains Canins, on rue Georges Clemenceau in Cannes, goes beyond classic grooming: the salon also offers a wellness area with spa, massages and balneotherapy for dogs and cats.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is open Monday to Saturday, from 9:30am to 6:30pm. A call or message before coming lets you check availability, especially if you'd like a spa treatment in addition to grooming.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if your dog has had a big beach day in Cannes, the balneotherapy session can really help relax them before grooming.</div>

